WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.500
Quickly check

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.834
with Paul

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:01.968
readers outside the courthouse

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:02.335
with who's

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.536
