00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.126
many of whom are still close associates.

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.161
So much like in the Mar

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:02.796
a Lago documents case,

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:04.464
the fact that so many people in his inner

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.099
circle are caught up in this.

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.701
That will likely be a difficult issue

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.536
to navigate.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:10.770
Just looking really quickly to see

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.273
if there are any other significant,

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.974
significant things from the judge.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:17.377
Yes, she's saying she's reminding him

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:18.778
that it is a crime

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.180
to influence a juror

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.482
or threaten a witness or retaliate

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:24.150
against anyone else

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.519
who provided information or otherwise

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.488
obstruct justice.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:28.788
Of course,

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:29.556
