00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.225
obstruction of justice,

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:34.394
but obstructing his own

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:35.995
alleged obstruction.

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:36.796
So she's going through

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.231
all of these standard things

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:38.998
that you would go through

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:39.933
with any defendant,

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:40.366
but again,

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.168
taking on a different significance

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.770
with the former leader of the free world.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.305
We are told again by our colleague,

00:01:45.305 --> 00:01:47.040
