00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.014
But I do think that it's important

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:28.314
to echo

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:29.682
something Van said,

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:30.650
to the degree that I know

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.584
the former president.

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:33.153
This is a sobering moment.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:34.154
There is going to be

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:35.221
this moment that it sets

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.389
and this is happening again.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:37.790
It is out of his hands.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.858
Things are out of his control

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:41.027
in this moment and as this legal process

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:41.961
carries out.

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:42.695
And I think that

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:44.063
