00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:50.570
what he can do

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.505
with witnesses, the jury and so forth,

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.239
that I think is

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.741
when his attorneys start getting nervous

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.643
because he tends to use his megaphone,

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:57.644
say whatever he thinks

00:02:57.644 --> 00:02:58.912
we know he's gone after.

00:02:58.912 --> 00:02:59.712
And in some ways I would say

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.214
intimidated Jack Smith.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.582
So I think it's also going to be notable

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:03.816
to watch how he reacts

00:03:03.816 --> 00:03:05.185
