00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:24.470
I'm doing this for you.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.471
And then to be able to go back,

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:26.072
he usually does some

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:27.073
big rally or something.

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:29.442
But, you know,

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.312
at some point, I would imagine

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:33.513
this is just not the way

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.915
that he thought it was going to work out.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:36.516
I think that

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:38.351
